ClashTracker / ClashTracker Root Installer — curated source snapshot

This repository is a curated, readable source snapshot of the ClashTracker
Android overlay (:app) and the ClashTracker Root Installer (:installer),
together with the source-only probe used to build the installer's native
payload.

It is NOT decompiled APK output and does NOT claim to be the complete or
original upstream source of any product. It is provided as-is, without any
warranty, and is NOT guaranteed to build without locally supplied assets and
native artifacts.

Nothing redistributed here is claimed to be original game, SDK or third-party
proprietary material:

- No APK is redistributed.
- No original game/SDK library (including libg.so or libscid_sdk.so) and no
  game card resource is redistributed. The probe is built locally by the user
  from the sources in probe/; the SDK the game loads is preserved from the
  user's own installation on the user's own device.
- No captured replay, account, device or other user data is redistributed;
  identifying values that remained in the retained text were replaced with
  conspicuous synthetic examples.
- No model weights or training replay are redistributed.

